## Development

```bash
# Run tests
pnpm nx test <%= name %>

# Lint
pnpm nx lint <%= name %>

# Run the bot locally (reads .env in this directory)
pnpm nx serve <%= name %>

# Build a Docker image
pnpm nx docker-build <%= name %>
```

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and fill in `BOT_TOKEN` (or `BOT_TOKEN_DEV` for
local development) before running.

## Deployment

Pushing to `main` with changes affecting this app triggers
`.github/workflows/release.yml`, which builds this app's `Dockerfile` and
pushes it to `ghcr.io/tanjd/<%= name %>`.
